  <div class="callout task">
    <div class="callout-title">The task: Two rocks, then one of yours</div>
    <p>Use the two figures on this page. For each, write whether the weathering is mechanical or chemical, the name of the process, and one thing you can see that proves it. Then find one weathered surface at school or at home and do the same for it. Notes go in your Class Notebook as a Power outline.</p>
  </div>
